  Description: "On Enable\nSet the CM Mount State Priority and Target\n(Set the Transforms
    to be the Mount <Camera Target>)\n\nOn Disable\nSend that the Animal is no longer
    being mounted \nDeactivate the CM Mount State\n\nThis is also used as the Camera
    Target when the Rider Mounts the Animal"
  ShowDescription: 1
